{"3179850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Farm & Store Simulator", "steam_appid": 3179850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of a farmer and entrepreneur in <strong>Farm &amp; Store Simulator</strong>, a captivating blend of farming, animal husbandry, and shop management. Grow fresh vegetables, raise happy animals, and transform your hard work into profits by managing your very own farm-to-table business!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cultivate Your Crops</strong>: Plant, water, and harvest a variety of seasonal crops. Time your harvests for the best yield and quality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise Adorable Livestock</strong>: Care for chickens, cows, and more. Feed them well, collect their products, and even expand your farm with breeding.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run Your Shop</strong>: Arrange your goods, set competitive prices, and charm customers with stellar service. Watch your small shop grow into a bustling marketplace!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt and Thrive</strong>: Stay ahead of market trends, participate in seasonal fairs, and expand your farm and shop with strategic investments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Your Legacy</strong>: Upgrade tools, unlock new products, and develop innovative farming techniques to build a business that thrives across all seasons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re selling fresh eggs and milk, or the sweetest strawberries in town, <strong>Farm &amp; Store Simulator</strong> is your ticket to a cozy yet strategic farming and business adventure. Can you turn your humble plot of land into a thriving empire? The choice is yours!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of a farmer and entrepreneur in <strong>Farm &amp; Store Simulator</strong>, a captivating blend of farming, animal husbandry, and shop management. Grow fresh vegetables, raise happy animals, and transform your hard work into profits by managing your very own farm-to-table business!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cultivate Your Crops</strong>: Plant, water, and harvest a variety of seasonal crops. Time your harvests for the best yield and quality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise Adorable Livestock</strong>: Care for chickens, cows, and more. Feed them well, collect their products, and even expand your farm with breeding.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run Your Shop</strong>: Arrange your goods, set competitive prices, and charm customers with stellar service. Watch your small shop grow into a bustling marketplace!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt and Thrive</strong>: Stay ahead of market trends, participate in seasonal fairs, and expand your farm and shop with strategic investments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Your Legacy</strong>: Upgrade tools, unlock new products, and develop innovative farming techniques to build a business that thrives across all seasons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re selling fresh eggs and milk, or the sweetest strawberries in town, <strong>Farm &amp; Store Simulator</strong> is your ticket to a cozy yet strategic farming and business adventure. Can you turn your humble plot of land into a thriving empire? The choice is yours!</p>", "short_description": "Grow your farm-to-table empire! Cultivate crops, raise animals, and manage your bustling market. Harvest, sell, and expand in this cozy yet strategic farming adventure. Can you build the ultimate marketplace?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179850/header.jpg?t=1758523394", "capsule_image":